    <summary>Specifies a current or active mode for a temperature control.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>These are individual mode codes, not flags. Do not combine them. Use <see cref="T:Android.Service.Controls.Templates.TemperatureControlTemplateFlagMode" /> for the supported-mode mask. Unknown is zero, while Off is a separate mode with value one.</para>
      <para>The values correspond to the <c>MODE_*</c> constants in the <see href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/99b01a65cc4c104933788b3143285ab6bae65827/core/java/android/service/controls/templates/TemperatureControlTemplate.java">Android temperature implementation</see>. See also the <see href="https://github.com/dotnet/java-interop/blob/92b5d471f1e0f6164fc332b1f661b472f5cf3aad/tools/generator/Java.Interop.Tools.Generator.CodeGeneration/EnumGenerator.cs">.NET enum generator</see>.</para>
    </remarks>
